     "<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n            <font size=\"4\">Hi all, </font><div><font size=\"4\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"4\">I am working with GGIR to process data on 24-hour movement behaviors. </font></div><div><font size=\"4\">When inspecting the part 5 output, I got pretty confused with the difference between the variables: </font></div><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);border-collapse:collapse;width:163pt\" width=\"217\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"min-height:16pt\" height=\"21\"><span style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium;white-space:nowrap;min-height:16pt;width:163pt\" width=\"217\" height=\"21\">ACC_day_VIG_unbt_mg  </span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);border-collapse:collapse;width:163pt\" width=\"217\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><span style=\"width:163pt\" width=\"217\"></span><span style=\"min-height:16pt\" height=\"21\"><span style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium;white-space:nowrap;min-height:16pt;width:163pt\" width=\"217\" height=\"21\"><br>ACC_day_total_VIG_mg</span></span></span></font><div><br></div><div><font size=\"4\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">From the vignette, I understand that </span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:large;white-space:nowrap\">ACC_day_VIG_unbt_mg refers only to the time that does not fall into bouts of activity. In contrast, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:large;white-space:nowrap\">ACC_day_total_VIG_mg refers to the average for periods of bouted AND unbouted activity.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:large;white-space:nowrap\">Is that correct? </span><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:large\">Could anyone possibly shed a light on this?</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:large;white-space:nowrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:large;white-space:nowrap\">Thank you all in advance! </span><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:large\"> </span></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
